WEBVTT

00:00:00.167 --> 00:00:02.443
Chalky hands? One big tap.

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:10.748
Small buttons and chalky hands do not mix. So one set fills the screen. Big weight, set count, your cue.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:18.677
Change the weight and the bar redraws. You see the plates for each side. Ninety-eight kilos, exact.

00:00:19.133 --> 00:00:25.913
Made it? Tap Made. The next set loads, one step up, and your rest timer starts.

00:00:26.367 --> 00:00:31.522
Missed? Tap Miss, then call it. You get the causes and the drills that fix it.

00:00:31.967 --> 00:00:35.543
Download Lifting Lab. No account. Free to start.
